# Dependency and build output. These are not answer code and must never be committed. One side ran
# `go mod vendor` before sealing on 2026-09-25, which put 227 MB of third-party source into its sealed
# commit: the sealed diff then measured 233 MB against the other side's 70 KB, tripped the
# acceptance-authoring size guard, and the Pair was lost. Ignoring them here keeps them out of the
# sealed commit, out of the baseline, and out of the published delivery from one place.
/vendor/
/node_modules/
/__pycache__/
/.venv/

